            <profile id="e72f-5cf7-e7f6-81ab" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="dab5-785d-be28-f228" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, full plate armour and shield. May be mounted on a horse (free) or warhorse (+4 pts) which may have plate barding (+6 pts). If on foot, may have double-handed weapon (+3 pts). Army General. Strategist. Grim Reputation: Vlad (but not his bodyguard) causes fear in enemy troops. Pagan Hatred: Hatred against Ottoman troops and their allies. Loyal Bodyguard: Vlad does not join any unit except his bodyguard of foreign mercenaries, a unit of Garda Domneasca (Ld 8, Veterans, partial plate armour at a basic cost of 16 pts for a dismounted guard model and 30 pts for a mounted guard model; additional equipment may be bought as normal). Walachian armies only. (Vlad the Impaler p.30)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="70cc-a1cb-fae2-a461" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Save" typeId="603e-2898-6af9-6cf1">3+</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="With conditional bonuses" typeId="5882-dd5a-bc28-4024">-</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="d5e4-804e-6192-0114">Armour save from armour, shield and barding bonus pips (rulebook pp.95-98); maximum 3+ (2+ for barded cavalry). M already includes encumbrance for armour/barding (p.96). Conditional pips are in the next column.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
              <!-- armour-save -->
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink id="09c4-b238-4289-a398" name="Army General (Chariot Wars)" hidden="false" targetId="592c-3ef3-9392-535a" type="rule"/>
            <infoLink id="2ef7-045f-1782-f9ca" name="Strategist" hidden="false" targetId="e372-9f0d-7a57-1723" type="rule"/>
