            </profile>
            <profile id="3984-4736-f7df-6c5f" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="dab5-785d-be28-f228" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, heavy armour, shield and warhorse. The warhorse may have cloth barding (+4 pts). May take a heavy mace (+5 pts). Army General. Strategist. Heavy Mace. Beloved Leader: his Ld radius as Army General is increased by D6", rolled at the start of the battle before deployment. Resilient: Wounds value increased by 1, but his small stature (5'5") is reflected in his decreased Strength and Toughness. Master of Ambushes: if Stefan is the army's General, the 0-2 restriction for Plaiesi/Darabanti is lifted. Moldavian armies only. (Vlad the Impaler p.30)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="417e-2100-8ce3-f213" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Save" typeId="603e-2898-6af9-6cf1">4+</characteristic>
