              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Three crewmen armed with hand weapon and light armour; may take two additional crewmen (10 pts each). Artillery. 0-1 Catapulta (Mangonel) or Tun (Bombard) per 1,000 pts. Bombards may only be used after 1448 (Walachia) or 1464 (Moldavia). (Vlad the Impaler p.29)</characteristic>
