  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="ac74-5276-768d-9e1f" name="Moldavia and Walachia (Vlad the Impaler) - List Notes" publicationId="dab5-785d-be28-f228" hidden="false">
      <description>MOLDAVIAN &amp; WALACHIAN ARMIES (Vlad the Impaler, pp.26-30): Great Host and Small Host armies of the Principalities of Moldavia and Walachia, 1330-1527. Special rules from the book: Scythe, Heavy Mace, Strategist, Eastern Shock Cavalry. Allies are documented only.

ARMY COMPOSITIONS (pick one in the Army composition list):
[Moldavia and Walachia - Walachia, Great Host (1330-1508)]
  Characters: up to 25%
  Small Host: up to 50%, at least 33%
  Great Host: up to 50%, at least 33%
  GREAT HOST, PRINCIPALITY OF WALACHIA, 1330-1508. Characters up to 25%; Small Host 33-50% (0-1 Viteji; 0-1 Garda Domneasca only if led by a Voievod; Curteni; 1+ Boieri; Calarasi; 1+ Lefegii per 1,000 pts; 0-1 Catapulta (Mangonel) or Tun (Bombard) per 1,000 pts, bombards only after 1448); Great Host 33-50% (1+ Pedestrasi per 1,000 pts, not in Small Host; Arcasi; 0-2 Plaiesi); Allies up to 20% (Hungarians 1371-1476, Serbians 1330-1389, Bulgarians 1330-1396, Ottomans 1420-1508, Moldavians 1371-1508 - no Great Host troops; documented only). All allies are subject to the Allies and Mercenaries rule.
[Moldavia and Walachia - Moldavia, Great Host (1359-1527)]
  Characters: up to 25%
  Small Host: up to 50%, at least 33%
  Great Host: up to 66%, at least 33%
  GREAT HOST, PRINCIPALITY OF MOLDAVIA, 1359-1527. Characters up to 25% (0-1 Voievod or Vornic, a Vornic may only lead armies of less than 2,000 pts; 0-1 Stegar; Dregator); Small Host 33-50% (as Walachia, bombards only after 1464); Great Host 33-66% (Pedestrasi; 1+ Razesi per 1,000 pts, not in Small Host; Arcasi; 0-2 Plaiesi); Allies up to 20% (Hungarians 1471-1504, Polish 1387-1491 from Armies of Chivalry, Ottomans 1489-1527, Walachians 1371-1527 - no Great Host troops; documented only).
[Moldavia and Walachia - Small Host Army (Moldavia or Walachia)]
  Characters: up to 25%
  Small Host: at least 50%
  Great Host: up to 15%
  SMALL HOST ARMY, MOLDAVIA OR WALACHIA. Characters up to 25% (0-1 Voievod or Vornic, a Vornic may only lead armies of less than 2,000 pts; 0-1 Stegar; Dregator); Small Host at least 50% from the Moldavian or Walachian Small Host troop list; Great Host up to 15% from the Moldavian or Walachian Great Host troops; Allies up to 33% from the Moldavian or Walachian allied troop lists above (documented only).</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
